OL,3,GNEWSASchool loses crossing patrols as
OL,4,Aapplicants dry up
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrandparent Joyce Drewery, speaking
OL,7,Foutside the school, said: "There's a
OL,8,Flot of cars and there's a lot of little
OL,9,Fones coming out. If there's no lollipop
OL,10,Fmen and ladies at all, then that's not
OL,11,Freally safe for the children."
